{"content":"The pass is blocked until day 5 (today is day 1). So the plan: read the notice board (confirms schedule), then spend the days productively farming the meadow soil, and be ready to head north on day 5.","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_00_3mf7VXpM1VgGH7AhOYvt0310","name":"submit_plan","args":{"approach":"Wiki says the Rockslide Pass (rock at 11,4) only clears on the morning of day 5 — today is day 1, so pushing north is wasted. Read the notice board to confirm, then till/plant/water parsnips in the meadow to pass the days, and walk to the pass gap on day 5 to reach the chest at (11,1).","steps":[{"kind":"walk_to","x":4,"y":7,"mode":"walk"},{"kind":"interact","x":3,"y":7,"button":"left"},{"kind":"wait","minutes":1},{"kind":"walk_to","x":5,"y":6,"mode":"walk"},{"kind":"interact","x":5,"y":6,"button":"left","slot":1},{"kind":"walk_to","x":6,"y":6,"mode":"walk"},{"kind":"interact","x":6,"y":6,"button":"left","slot":1},{"kind":"walk_to","x":7,"y":6,"mode":"walk"},{"kind":"interact","x":7,"y":6,"button":"left","slot":1},{"kind":"walk_to","x":5,"y":6,"mode":"walk"},{"kind":"interact","x":5,"y":6,"button":"left","slot":3},{"kind":"walk_to","x":6,"y":6,"mode":"walk"},{"kind":"interact","x":6,"y":6,"button":"left","slot":3},{"kind":"walk_to","x":7,"y":6,"mode":"walk"},{"kind":"interact","x":7,"y":6,"button":"left","slot":3},{"kind":"walk_to","x":5,"y":6,"mode":"walk"},{"kind":"interact","x":5,"y":6,"button":"left","slot":2},{"kind":"walk_to","x":6,"y":6,"mode":"walk"},{"kind":"interact","x":6,"y":6,"button":"left","slot":2},{"kind":"walk_to","x":7,"y":6,"mode":"walk"},{"kind":"interact","x":7,"y":6,"button":"left","slot":2},{"kind":"wait","minutes":60},{"kind":"walk_to","x":11,"y":5,"mode":"walk"},{"kind":"wait","minutes":60}]}}],"ms":3252,"cached":false,"usage":{"prompt":1988,"completion":797}}